{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "量云：真故極成，色是有法，定不\n離眼識宗。因云：自許初三攝，眼所不攝故。同喻如眼識。釋見後文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "量云：有為是有法，定空無性是\n宗。因云：從緣生故。同喻云：如幻法。幻法從緣生，幻法空無性；有為從緣生，有為空無性。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "量云：無為是有\n法，定無實故是宗。法因云：不起故。同喻云：如空華。空華無有起，空華無有實；無為無有起，無為亦無實。□出\n大乘掌珍論一。論唯釋此二種比量。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此標名，下釋義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋上能立二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓謂不缺，明謂不謬。此釋真字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "由所立真故，即能生他智果。下反此可知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無分別智得境自性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如見煙知火"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不稱實境而知故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "瓶衣假合，非真現量境"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自證分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同喻見分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自證分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自證分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自證分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自證分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自證\n分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自證分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自證分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前陳宗依"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後陳\n宗體"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本質色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "相分色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即前陳差別"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "相分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "相分色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自證分宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同申一有法云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後陳定相翻云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此論前陳\n意許也。不改先因云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻異作同云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此合也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此離也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂自立義令他解了"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "顯自許之言無他隨一等過"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於他立中出宗因過"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無違宗等失"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於他立中\n出比量過"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無自教等失"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廣百\n論是諍意許，此但言陳，故不同耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即霧等性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "且按定同品下，舉因出過"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一分轉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一分不轉。此不應無而無，即乖同品定有性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以瓶由人工無間得成故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以瓶全體是無常故，\n即異品徧轉。此不應轉而轉，即乖異品徧無性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此句按定下，出不定之相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兩趣不定，意因不成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以手舉鼓，手是\n執受，鼓是不執受，故曰俱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦勤發類故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此句貫下二於字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即同品徧轉也，此不\n為過"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "皆非勤發類故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即異\n品一分轉也，此正是過"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此不為過"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此立量，下辯過"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "外道計微塵常故，亦入此同品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此句\n貫下四个於字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空無質礙故，即一分轉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "塵有質礙\n故，即一分不轉，此不應無而無也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "瓶、樂皆無常故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同無質礙，一分轉，此不應轉而轉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "瓶有質礙，一分不轉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宗之自相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宗之差別相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "相違之因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻也。上立量，下辯違"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此他即是我"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先出過名，後言所以"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此他屬他人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大即地水火風空，等即等餘二十二法。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非實、德、業、宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦非大有性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "既能遮此，定亦遮彼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "詳見華嚴玄談八卷及勝宗十句論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "未論此性有非有等差別故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有一實故，有德業故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非實非德非業"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有實體之有性，無實體之有性，是有法差別"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以成大有性，離一切法有自性故，即於有作緣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以遮有性故，即於非有作緣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "實等非實等，實\n等非有性，以例有性非有性，有性亦非有也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此宗因向下三種不成，俱承此\n說去"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "離"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "分別心略有三種：一、自性分別，唯緣\n現在所緣諸行自相行分別。所緣行，即五塵也。自相行，如色以青為行相，眼識緣時亦任運作青行相，名\n自行。又自相即能緣行，簡共相行，如緣青時即緣黃不著。二、隨念分別，於昔曾所受諸行追念行分別，唯\n緣過去。三、計度分別，於去來今不現前思搆行分別，即非有計有，是非量境。然約三世計度，不定一世，自\n性分別即無分別也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十三過，總名缺減過性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宗中九過"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因中十四過"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻中十過"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦此總句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
